 AI are things headed to Edge  Computing or things that are de  Federated learning I happen to believe  some of this but you need to make that  on your own by talking to people  observing whatever and then  starting to learn becoming more and more  of an expert on the thing which you do  not know how to do  so that you can then head to the do part  of the cycle and end up being a  practitioner of generative AI or  whatever the subject matter is  but think about it as a cycle it's not a  one and done  I mean you know you've heard the  lifelong learning story I think many  times in fact all the folks at DCI here  are examples of thinking about the world  as you know I got to keep learning and I  really counsel you to think that way  think that way because it's the way you  want to manage your career you want to  be thinking about where the future is  you want to be learning you're all great  students about the thing that is going  to be in front of you so that you're  never going to be Obsolete and you will  be managing this you're the making the  choice of doing that  and I I really counsel you to spend the  time lots of people spend lots of time  on a lot of other things and they don't  spend time on their career and if you  think about it it's like one of the  biggest assets you have so manage it  uh lesson six  you have the best email address the just  how how long I've been teaching this  class uh this slide used to say you have  the best business card you're ever going  to have and I just changed it because I  go who the hell has a business card  anymore but uh you have the best email  address you're ever going to have  all right  um  I will tell you pretty much anybody will  answer your email because it says  stanford.edu  uh and your student  and you know you want to know about  something you want to meet somebody you  want to learn something  they're all going hey she's a student  right  as soon as you take a job with pick your  poison you know Google Faceboo